<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Lo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lo</para>
  <para style="mt">Lo</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />Ana Moses ere mogl, ka ta ama Israel yoba yegl di togwa, Yawe muglo Horep doga wagle atne mogl, ene ka di togwa igne i ene ye ogo nagie mo i ta kankrikwa. Yegl pre ene kan kun erio! <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" />Ene mabuno kide ere, taragl swara ta kwiano kamage ere tenamnedi bekekrio! Taragl yagl mo abu mere <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" />mo agl bugla mo dua kabu ta makandigle moglkwa mere mo kua ta kamun mitna pru dugwa mere <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />mo taragl kebra ta makan mina wanugwa mere mo buglo bagle ta nigl atne moglkwa mere yegl ta bekekrio! <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" />Te, ene kan mitna ibo edidre, ade ba ya kugl kuri kanaiglkwa i, ene kan kun erio! Ene nomane kide idre, taragl i goglkono bodugl tedre, kagno kade tedre, kamage ere te dinaiglmiwa. Yawe ene Godno moglkwa i, ye taragl i yoba mudu yugobuno pere pere uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, ere yei tomiwe di, Moses yegl dugwa.<verse eid="DEU 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s">Moses goglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Ana Moses ere mogl, dumo Moap auduno i kide kodidre, ede pi muglo meglbi ta Nebo we dimara i pidre, muglo meglbi ta Pisga we dimara ede pi muglo kaima ibo ogwa. Muglo meglbi Pisga i, dumo ta Jeriko we dimara koglo ibo kra yogwa. Ye ede muglo ibo ogo, Yawe ere mogl, dumo makan Israel yoba tenabuka i, ye mudu Moses obuno di togwa. Ye dumo Gileat we dimara obuno di te ede pi dumo Dan yomara obuno di togwa. <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />Yawe ye Moses dumo i obuno di tedre, Israel yoba yugobuno tau swara swarade makan inaiglmere i obuno di togwa. Ye Naptali yoba makan inaiglkwa i, obuno di tedre, Efraim ya Manase yoba makan inaiglkwa i, obuno di tedre, Juda yoba makano yei ede pi mudi nigl Mediterenian bina yenabuka i obuno di togwa. <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />Ye dumo i obuno di tedre, dumo makan kade ta Negev we dimara obuno di tedre, dumo auduno ta yogwa, taun Jeriko yei ede pi taun Soar yomara i, obuno di togwa. Taun Jeriko we digwa i, ede ta det we digwa mere paigwa. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" />Ana Yawe ye dumo mudu i Moses obuno di tedre, ye ere mogl, Moses yegl di togwa, Ene dumo mudu kanga i, na dumo ta okna Abraham ya Aisak ya Jekop ka giglede di te padigl, Ene gawanoma tenagle diga i yogwa. Na ene kanatnga pre obuno di teiga ba ene ta suna pikratniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="DEU 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Ana Yawe ka yegl di kodugo, Moses, Yawe nigl kogonmo yagle moglkwa i, dumo Moap i mogl, Yawe ye gorabe dumere goglkwa. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" />Moses goglko, Yawe ye dumo Moap suna i, taun ta Betpeor we dimara prak iro, dumo auduno kebra ta yomara maugl sugwa. Maugl sugwa ba ye dumo i suna aglo mere maugl sugwa i, yoba pre kan erekriko, nono erme ama pre kan erekunga. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Ana Moses goglkwa igne i ye bugla yugu 120 nedre, goglkwa. Bugla yugu podo nogwa ba ye gumuglo kin yekruko, yobuglomo pai moglkwa. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Moses goglko, Yawe ye maugl sugo, Israel yoba dumo Moap auduno yomara i mogl, ege 30-pela de Moses kai ere tedre, gaba buko digo, dudugwa.<verse eid="DEU 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Ana Josua, Nun wam moglkwa i we, Moses kor moglkwa igne, Josua ye agaimo inabedi ogo ye bre mina bolamugl paduglko, Josua nomane podo yugwa. Nomane podo yugo, Israel yoba ye kamo prisre, Yawe okna ye eraiglkwa pamiwedi Moses ka di tomere i erikwa.<verse eid="DEU 34:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>